  "label": "anti-immigrant sentiment audience",
  "description": "The meme is designed for an audience that holds or is receptive to anti-immigrant stereotypes, particularly those who believe immigrants are a burden or waste, and who may support restrictive immigration policies. The target audience is likely individuals who are politically or socially inclined toward xenophobic views, and who may be influenced by rhetoric that frames immigration as a threat to national resources or social order. The dehumanizing metaphor of sperm is intended to resonate with those who already hold negative perceptions about immigration, reinforcing their biases and potentially normalizing prejudice against immigrant communities.",
